    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial portfolio of vacant buildings occupying a prime town location on a plot extending to approximately 1,100 sq. metres.\nThe property occupies a prominent position directly opposite Lidl and overlooks a major road junction, offering excellent visibility and significant redevelopment potential.\nThe site comprises a large, wall-enclosed plot incorporating:\n•2 no. terraced houses, one of which includes a ground-floor retail unit;\n•A substantial rear lawn/yard area;\n•3 no. additional individual buildings to the rear, previously laid out as a number of apartments/residential units;\n•The entire property is contained within 3 individual folios.\nHaving been vacant for a number of years, the combination of the existing buildings, substantial site area and three separate folios presents a rare opportunity for redevelopment, refurbishment or residential conversion, subject to the necessary planning and statutory approvals.\nThe property may also offer potential to benefit from financial incentives associated with the expanded March 2026 Commercial-to-Residential framework, subject to eligibility and confirmation by the relevant authorities.\nThis is a unique town-centre investment and development opportunity with considerable potential.\nEnquiries are welcome. Viewing strictly by appointment.\nOffers in writing will be accepted up until 5.30pm 7th Oct 2026 (unless prev. sold)."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "2 Sitting Rooms, 2 Kitchens, 3 Bedrooms, Shop Unit/4th Bedroom, 2 Bathrooms<br><br>\nSitting Room 1 - 4.0m x 3.2m <br>Open fire,\nDual aspect windows.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room 2 - 4.5m x 3.5m <br>Open fire,\nDual aspect windows.<br><br><br>\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.4m x 2.4m <br>Window overlooking rear garden.<br><br><br>\nCommercial Unit - Retail Space - 7.5m x 3.8m <br>PVC front door,\nLarge front display window.<br><br><br>\nCommercial Unit - Kitchenette - 2.4m x 2.2m <br><br><br><br>\nCommercial Unit - WC - 2.4m x 0.9m <br>WHB & WC,\nAccessed off kitchenette,\nRear window.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.2m <br>Open fire,\nDual aspect windows.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 2 - 4.5m x 3.5m <br>Triple aspect windows.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 3 - 3.8m x 3.0m <br>Front facing window.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 3.2m x 2.4m <br>WHB, WC & Bath.<br><br><br>\nStorage room/Bedroom 4 - Above commercial unit - 4.8m x 4.3m <br>Currently used as a store room,\nRear facing window.<br><br>"
      },
